{"type":"text","timestamp":1778975724426,"sessionID":"ses_1cccbecf5ffeX5PzJALhbXd9oH","part":{"id":"prt_e33373c70001JnleeJ7uoEEEBn","messageID":"msg_e33373814001AjeiAOdVPmBQRO","sessionID":"ses_1cccbecf5ffeX5PzJALhbXd9oH","type":"text","text":"Implemented and committed the issue #9933 update locally.\n\n**Commit**\n`488b392 Update GINS3 Meier-Gorlin syndrome`\n\n**Ontology Changes**\nUpdated `src/ontology/mondo-edit.obo` for `MONDO:0980992` (`Meier-Gorlin syndrome 9`):\n\n- Added a definition citing `OMIM:621512` and `PMID:38773883`.\n- Added exact synonym `GINS3 Meier-Gorlin syndrome` citing `PMID:38773883`.\n- Added `has_material_basis_in_germline_mutation_in http://identifiers.org/hgnc/25851` for `GINS3`.\n- Added the issue tracker property for issue #9933.\n\n**Validation**\n- Verified `PMID:38773883` via PubMed.\n- Verified `HGNC:25851` as approved human gene `GINS3` via HGNC REST.\n- Ran ROBOT syntax validation successfully:\n  `robot convert --catalog src/ontology/catalog-v001.xml -i src/ontology/mondo-edit.obo -f obo -o mondo-edit.TMP.obo`\n- Could not run required ODK normalization because `docker` is not installed in this environment.\n\n**Requested Files**\nCreated uncommitted files:\n\n- `ISSUE_COMMENTS.md`\n- `PR_COMMENTS.md`\n\nOnly `src/ontology/mondo-edit.obo` was committed. The worktree still contains unrelated pre-existing untracked/deleted evaluation/config files, plus the two requested uncommitted comment files.","time":{"start":1778975718512,"end":1778975724424}}}
